000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. COND1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  A                   PIC 99    VALUE 5.
000060 01  B                   PIC 99    VALUE 7.
000070 01  FIRST-NAME          PIC X(8)  VALUE "ADA".
000080 01  PART-CODE           PIC X(3)  VALUE "12A".
000090 01  BALANCE             PIC S9(3) VALUE -12.
000100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000110*    RELATION CONDITIONS
000120     IF A < B DISPLAY "A < B" END-IF
000130     IF A IS LESS THAN B DISPLAY "A IS LESS THAN B" END-IF
000140     IF B >= 7 DISPLAY "B >= 7" END-IF
000150     IF B IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 7
000160         DISPLAY "B IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 7"
000170     END-IF
000180     IF A NOT = B DISPLAY "A NOT = B" END-IF
000190     IF FIRST-NAME = "ADA" DISPLAY "PADDED: EQUAL" END-IF
000200     IF FIRST-NAME < "BOB" DISPLAY "ADA COMES BEFORE BOB" END-IF
000210     IF FIRST-NAME > "AD" DISPLAY "ADA COMES AFTER AD" END-IF
000220*    CLASS CONDITIONS
000230     IF PART-CODE IS NOT NUMERIC DISPLAY "12A NOT NUMERIC" END-IF
000240     IF PART-CODE (1:2) IS NUMERIC
000250         DISPLAY "FIRST TWO ARE NUMERIC"
000260     END-IF
000270     IF FIRST-NAME IS ALPHABETIC
000280         DISPLAY "FIRST-NAME IS ALPHABETIC (SPACES COUNT)"
000290     END-IF
000300     IF FIRST-NAME IS ALPHABETIC-UPPER
000310         DISPLAY "FIRST-NAME IS ALPHABETIC-UPPER"
000320     END-IF
000330     IF FIRST-NAME IS NOT ALPHABETIC-LOWER
000340         DISPLAY "FIRST-NAME IS NOT ALPHABETIC-LOWER"
000350     END-IF
000360*    SIGN CONDITIONS
000370     IF BALANCE IS NEGATIVE DISPLAY "BALANCE IS NEGATIVE" END-IF
000380     IF A IS POSITIVE DISPLAY "A IS POSITIVE" END-IF
000390     IF BALANCE IS NOT ZERO DISPLAY "BALANCE IS NOT ZERO" END-IF
000400     STOP RUN.
